        "id": 39368,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-29T16:09:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The backstory for the Fallen Five is brilliant. &nbsp;I love how close each one is to the real hero yet twisted in just the right way. &nbsp;They're so well done in fact, I'd worry that they would be better as something an entire expansion was built around rather than just the fourth villain in an expansion that's already been built by the game designers. &nbsp;They may be too good to win. :)</p><p>The Empty Child is creepy, which is great, and between it and the Five, it feels like the Child would probably be a more different play experience than what we've seen before. &nbsp;I think both villains are wonderful, but between the two, I'd vote for the Empty Child.</p><p>Great job!</p>",
