        "raw": "<p>Great story on both, it&#39;s easy to see how they fit into the setting. I agree with the other guys, the Child is the best of the two, I really like the Entanglement mechanic - something new and different without being difficult to track.&nbsp;</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
